{"id": "next-flag-switch", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["今晚换彩排旗，我拿蓝色，你拿白色。", "我临时把蓝旗借给了灯光组。你拿白旗的分工没变。", "开场只举你手里那面，应该举哪面？"], "criterion": "举白旗，不把借出的蓝旗当自己手里。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "蓝色和白色，谁先拿？", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.75, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 29, "prompt_tokens": 144, "total_tokens": 173, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "白旗还是你，蓝旗归灯光组。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.682, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 19, "prompt_tokens": 187, "total_tokens": 206, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "你举白旗，我举蓝旗。谁举哪旗，谁就负责。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.453, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 56, "prompt_tokens": 227, "total_tokens": 283, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "next-robot-greeting", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我做了个坏脾气送餐机器人，台词想听起来客气，但手上在发火。", "它送错桌了。帮我补一句它当场会说的话，别用旁白解释它在生气。"], "criterion": "直接给机器人一句客气中带不满的道歉或补救台词。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "你刚把垃圾塞进垃圾桶，我这就去给你递个热腾腾的饭。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.961, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 40, "prompt_tokens": 149, "total_tokens": 189, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "我这就去帮你找。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.51, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 14, "prompt_tokens": 206, "total_tokens": 220, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "next-credit-note", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把开幕标牌写完了，顾雨给它描的边。", "印之前才发现正面的字也是顾雨补过的，我只裁纸。", "背面怎么给我们署名？"], "criterion": "顾雨对应文字和描边，观众对应裁纸。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "好，我这就把标牌贴好。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.83, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 31, "prompt_tokens": 143, "total_tokens": 174, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "先裁纸，再补。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.951, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 29, "prompt_tokens": 183, "total_tokens": 212, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "背面留个空，署名就写在背面。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "confused", "reply_to": ["m3"], "seconds": 1.336, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 43, "prompt_tokens": 211, "total_tokens": 254, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "next-quiet-return", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我总算把连不上语音的那关打完了，录音后来发现忘开。", "队友说也能补录，我倒想留一段静音回忆。先别帮我列补救步骤。"], "criterion": "承接静音的取舍，可用趣味说法，不给补录方案。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "终于把语音连上了，录音也记得开。刚才那关太卡，我差点就忘了。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.278, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 47, "prompt_tokens": 147, "total_tokens": 194, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "队友说能补录，我留一段静音。先别列步骤，先听。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.286, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 205, "total_tokens": 246, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "next-step-bell", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["小剧场最后一场我要学门口那位说话，你帮我报暗号。铃响两次才上台。", "乐手把暗号改了，两声是候场，开场要等一长声。", "台后响了两短声，我出去吗？"], "criterion": "明确候场、等一长声；观众负责上台。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "暗号是“小剧场最后一场”。铃响两次才上台。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.88, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 152, "total_tokens": 188, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "乐手把暗号改了。两声是候场，开场要等一长声。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.158, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "prompt_tokens": 203, "total_tokens": 245, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "两声是候场，开场要等一长声。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m3"], "seconds": 1.13, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 250, "total_tokens": 286, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "next-wrong-name", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["纸偶叫打瞌睡，那只猫没名字，但它总在第一个镜头冲进来。", "我不想沿用纸偶的名字，猫的小牌子上该写什么？"], "criterion": "给猫另起贴合抢先入镜的名字。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "纸偶叫打瞌睡，那只猫没名字，但它总在第一个镜头冲进来。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.086, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 150, "total_tokens": 191, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "猫的名字该写在它的小牌子上。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.873, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 31, "prompt_tokens": 200, "total_tokens": 231, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "next-next-cut", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我剪好的上半段留着，片尾那段是你剪的。", "片尾刚补了一个黑屏，观众说以为断流了，其实想让他们听到水滴。", "你要在黑屏上加一行提示，能直接给我文案吗？"], "criterion": "给一行可放画面的文案，点出可以听水滴，避免误报断流。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "剪了。上半段留给你，片尾那段我剪。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.938, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 35, "prompt_tokens": 144, "total_tokens": 179, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "补了。黑屏后，我剪了，观众听见水滴。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.821, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 23, "prompt_tokens": 195, "total_tokens": 218, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "黑屏时，我剪了。观众听见水滴。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m3"], "seconds": 1.136, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 34, "prompt_tokens": 239, "total_tokens": 273, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "next-small-toast", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["今天同人摊比上次多来了一位客人，我已经很开心了。", "她只问了原画作者是谁，没买东西，我就想跟你讲这个小开心。"], "criterion": "承接那位客人的问题和小开心，不替观众设销售目标或编成交。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "客人来了，我也很高兴。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.842, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 31, "prompt_tokens": 144, "total_tokens": 175, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "她只问了原画作者是谁，没买东西，我就想跟你讲这个小开心。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.134, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 43, "prompt_tokens": 184, "total_tokens": 227, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
